W AX3053 340-effect-op-value.ax:10:6-10 unhandled-operation "`main` reaches operation `ask` of effect `Ask` with no handler: the process would write `axiom: unhandled effect` and exit 71 there - in `main`'s own body" #"reaches `Ask` with nothing handling it" ?"install one - `(handle BODY (E) HANDLER)` around the call - or, if an unhandled operation of this effect is a deliberate abort as `Assert`'s is, write `;@axiom:unhandled(trap)` above its `effect` declaration"
E AX3017 340-effect-op-value.ax:11:18-21 effect-handler-unsupported "effect operation `ask` cannot be used as a bare value; call it, or wrap it: `(lambda (x) (ask x))`"
E AX3011 340-effect-op-value.ax:11:12-17 effect-mismatch "effect mismatch: unhandled effect `Ask`"
